    subgraph OFFLINE ["⚡ 2. ARQUITETURA FIRST-OFFLINE (Zero-Latency)"]
        OFF_SW["Service Worker (Workbox / Vite PWA)\n• CacheFirst para App Shell e Assets\n• NetworkFirst para APIs com Fallback Local"]
